Henri, an elderly man with stooped posture, short wavy combed gray hair, a full gray beard, and brown eyes, wearing a long grey wool overcoat, an orange wool scarf, brown corduroy trousers, and black lace-up shoes, walks forward carrying Léa in his arms, his body angled toward his car parked along the riverside street. Léa, a stocky toddler girl with chin-length straight brown hair, bangs at her eyebrows, and brown eyes, dressed in a red knit cardigan, grey trousers, and brown ankle boots, rests firmly in his arms, her head turned to look up into his face with anxious eyes, pulled-down brows, and tightly pressed lips. Below them on the wet grey pavement, the dark shape CHR001, an adult-height flat black silhouette with long thin limbs and a smooth featureless head, stretches out across the stone curbside. In the midground rises the warm ochre and cream stone facade of the Landvogteischloss with its stepped-gable roofline and round stair turret, adjacent to the tiled brown roof of the covered wooden bridge spanning the dark green river under forested hills of orange and brown autumn foliage in the fading dusk light. A tall black iron lamppost rises by the sidewalk, near which an ambient passerby in a plain dark purple coat walks down the street. Ultra-wide shot capturing the sweeping stone street, castle, and river.

---METADATA---
