Élodie, a young adult woman with an average build, wavy loose light brown hair falling to mid-back with a center part, brown eyes, a soft jawline, and a small silver necklace on a thin chain, kneels beside the white enamel bathtub on the grey bath mat. She wears a yellow chunky knit turtleneck sweater, a long black cotton skirt, black tights, and black ankle boots. Her hands grip the chrome bath tap at the head of the tub, rotating the handle as a heavy stream of water rushes noisily into the porcelain basin. White ceramic tiles cover the bathroom walls, reflecting the warm indoor light, while a folded blue towel rests on a metal rail beside the tub and a small frosted window reveals the bare dark branches of an autumn tree outside in the dusk. Medium shot focused on Élodie kneeling in the brightly lit bathroom, her eyes directed downward at the tap handle with calm, level brows and closed lips.

---METADATA---
