Seen from high above looking down into the brightly lit white bathroom, Léa, a stocky toddler girl with chin-length straight brown hair and brown eyes, wearing purple cotton pyjamas, sits inside the white enamel tub beside Jules, holding up both hands to count on her fingers, her brows furrowed, eyes wide with apprehension, and lips parted as she watches her brother. Jules, a slim kindergartner boy with short dark brown hair, combed bangs above his eyebrows, and blue eyes, wearing blue cotton pyjamas, sits in the water beside her, holding a cluster of soap bubbles in his cupped palms with focused eyes and an open, counting mouth. Beside the tub, Élodie, a young adult woman with wavy light brown hair to mid-back, wearing a yellow knit turtleneck and black skirt, kneels on the grey bath mat with one hand resting against the tub rim, watching Léa with calm eyes and a level expression. In the foreground, spanning straight across the white rounded rim of the bathtub next to Léa, lies the dark shape CHR001—a solid, flat, near-black silhouette with long thin arms and a smooth rounded head, cast across the porcelain edge.

---METADATA---
