In the warm living room, Marc, a young adult man of average build with short dark brown wavy hair brushed back with a side part, brown eyes, and an angular jawline, stands upright on the red-and-cream wool rug. He wears a brown waxed cotton field jacket, a white henley shirt, dark blue denim jeans with a black leather belt, and brown lace-up boots. He holds ART002.1, a closed teal cloth-bound picture book with cream page edges, firmly in one hand at waist level, his eyes looking straight down at the cover with calm, level brows and his mouth parted mid-speech as he counts down aloud. Behind him in the cozy room, a grey fabric sofa draped with a knitted throw sits against the cream wall, beside a wooden bookshelf filled with books and a low wooden coffee table with a ceramic mug. Medium shot capturing Marc standing centered on the wooden floorboards.

---METADATA---
