A close-up view of the child's single bed shows the pale blue-printed duvet and smooth white pillow resting against the wooden headboard under the pale green bedroom wall. Stretched diagonally across the surface of the duvet and pillow is the dark shape CHR001, a solid flat near-black silhouette of a slim human form with long arms and a rounded featureless head. Pinned partially beneath the black silhouette, the forearm-sized plush rabbit Pompon ART001—made of soft cream plush fabric with short limbs and small black bead eyes—lies mostly concealed under the dark profile, with only its single long cream floppy ear extending free above the edge of the shadow onto the white pillow. A small wooden bedside table with a round tin sits visible at the right edge in the soft evening room light.

