In the upstairs hallway on the pale blue runner rug, Léa, a toddler girl with straight brown hair, bangs, and brown eyes, wearing purple cotton pyjamas and bare feet, stands facing left toward her open bedroom doorway, firmly stamping her foot down against the wooden floorboards with brows tightly furrowed, eyes wide with fear, and mouth open in a sharp shout. Right beside her on the floor, the dark shape CHR001, a flat solid black silhouette of a slim figure, mirrors her exact pose, stamping its dark silhouette foot onto the floorboards. Just behind her, Jules, a slim kindergartner boy with short dark brown hair, blue eyes, and blue cotton pyjamas with grey wool socks, stands facing right toward Léa, watching her with a calm, neutral gaze, slightly raised brows, and closed lips. The cream-painted corridor walls stretch past the bedroom door frame with a small lit wall lamp casting a gentle glow. Medium shot of the two children in the hallway.

